      "message": "Qt: Apply pending I/O Graph UAT changes when changing profiles\n\nListen for the signal that the profile is about to change,\nand apply pending UAT changes that haven't been saved to disk\nbefore the profile change.\n\nThe configuration change dialog is most, and most uses of UatModel\nare from the preference dialogs, which are also modal, but the I/O\nGraphs dialog can be open while changing profiles.\n\nThis also makes sure that the dialog can close even if for some\nreason the uat model pointer is null.\n",
